UnitVelodromeMigrationEntrypoint::constructor
├── when the owner is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
├── when the v3 token is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the v3 voting escrow is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the Hyperlane mailbox is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the OP domain is zero
│   └── it should revert with InvalidDomain
├── when the OP domain is equal to the mailbox local domain
│   └── it should revert with InvalidDomain
└── when passing valid parameters
    ├── it should call localDomain on the Hyperlane mailbox
    ├── it should set the owner
    └── it should set the entrypoint configuration

UnitVelodromeMigrationEntrypoint::onERC721Received
├── when the caller is not the v3 voting escrow
│   └── it should revert with InvalidERC721Transfer
└── when the caller is the v3 voting escrow
    ├── when the operator is not the entrypoint contract
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidERC721Transfer
    └── when the operator is the entrypoint contract
        └── it should return the ERC721 receiver selector

UnitVelodromeMigrationEntrypoint::burnRemaining
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the remaining balance is zero
│   ├── it should return zero from remaining
│   ├── it should burn zero
│   └── it should emit RemainingBurned with zero
├── when the remaining balance is positive
│   ├── it should return the remaining balance
│   ├── it should burn the full remaining balance
│   └── it should emit RemainingBurned with the remaining balance
└── when burnRemaining is called repeatedly
    ├── it should burn zero on the repeated call
    └── it should emit RemainingBurned with zero on the repeated call

UnitVelodromeMigrationEntrypoint::renounceOwnership
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the remaining balance is positive
│   └── it should revert with RemainingBalance
└── when the remaining balance is zero
    ├── it should renounce ownership
    └── it should emit OwnershipTransferred
